==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|вели́кій||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*velikъ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|вели́кий}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-великий.ogg}}

===Adjective===
{{ru-adj|вели́кий|peri|comp2=бо́льший|велича́йший|absn=величина́}}

# [[large]], [[big]]
#: {{syn|ru|большо́й|q1=more common in modern Russian}}
# [[great]], [[outstanding]]

====Usage notes====
* The short form should not be conflated with the adjective {{m|ru|вели́к||too big}}, which has [[lexicalize]]d as a short-form-only adjective in its own right.
* A special short form is found in the expression {{m|ru|[[от]] '''ма́ла''' [[до]] [[великий|вели́ка]]||[[all ages]]|lit=from [[small]] to [[big]]}}. Here '''ма́ла''' and '''вели́ка''' are old short genitives.

